# fantasy-sports-airflow navigation

- **This repo:** `fantasy-sports-airflow` (DAGs, `include/`, SQL templates, tests).
- **Schema DDL:** sibling **`fantasy-sports-db`** — do not invent columns, FKs, or unique keys without checking `nascar/ddl/` there.
- **DAG / importer work:** read [`docs/nascar/README.md`](../../docs/nascar/README.md) and the matching `docs/nascar/cup.*.md` for the DAG you change.
- **Full workflow:** [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) and [`CONTRIBUTING.md`](../../CONTRIBUTING.md).

## Commands

- Prefer `uv run ...` or [`script/test`](../../script/test), not bare `pytest` (coverage addopts are in `pyproject.toml`).
- `./script/format`, `./script/lint` before tests when touching Python.

## Backfill DAGs

- Hidden in UI unless `FS_ENABLE_BACKFILL_DAGS=1` in `.env` (restart scheduler after toggle).
- Unit tests enable backfill via [`tests/conftest.py`](../../tests/conftest.py).

## Do not

- Edit user plan files under `.cursor/plans/` unless explicitly asked.
- Revert unrelated local changes or expand scope beyond the request.

File-scoped rules under `.cursor/rules/` apply when you edit matching paths (DAGs, SQL, Python, integration tests).
